-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data NOT covered by the Apache License
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository does NOT include the following files derived from Allen
Institute data. MACAT needs them at run time, and each user builds them from
Allen's public release (see data/reference/README.md, "Rebuilding them"). Once
built, they are not licensed under the Apache License 2.0; they remain under
the Allen Institute's terms below, which permit NONCOMMERCIAL use only. See
data/reference/README.md for the per-file details and the changes made.

1. data/reference/allen_abc_region_by_gene.csv
   data/reference/allen_abc_section_by_gene.csv
   data/reference/allen_abc_sagittal_by_gene.csv

   Derived from the Allen Brain Cell Atlas, dataset MERFISH-C57BL6J-638850
   (expression release 20230830; CCF parcellation release 20231215),
   (c) Allen Institute for Brain Science.
   Source: https://alleninstitute.github.io/abc_atlas_access/
   License: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
            (CC BY-NC 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
   Changes: per-cell expression aggregated to mean expression per CCF region,
            per coronal section, and per sagittal band.
   Citation: Yao, Z. et al. A high-resolution transcriptomic and spatial atlas
             of cell types in the whole mouse brain. Nature 624, 317-332 (2023).
             https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z

2. data/reference/structure_tree_safe_2017.csv

   The Allen Mouse Brain Common Coordinate Framework (CCFv3, 2017) structure
   ontology, (c) Allen Institute for Brain Science, as distributed in
   https://github.com/cortex-lab/allenCCF (byte-identical copy, unmodified).
   Terms: Allen Institute Terms of Use, https://alleninstitute.org/terms-of-use/
   Citation: Wang, Q. et al. The Allen Mouse Brain Common Coordinate Framework:
             A 3D Reference Atlas. Cell 181, 936-953 (2020).
             https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2020.04.007

3. data/positive_control/sections.csv, sections/, reference_holdout/
   (not included; built locally by scripts/data/build_positive_control.py,
   see data/positive_control/README.md)

   Per-section values (expected level, orientation, cell counts) and per-cell
   coordinates, counts and CCF labels, derived from:
   a) the Allen Brain Cell Atlas MERFISH-C57BL6J-638850 data above
      (CC BY-NC 4.0; Yao et al. 2023), and
   b) the datasets Zhuang-ABCA-1 and Zhuang-ABCA-3, generated by the Zhuang lab
      (Zhang et al. 2023) and distributed in the Allen Brain Cell Atlas
      (https://alleninstitute.github.io/abc_atlas_access/descriptions/Zhuang_dataset.html).
      License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
               https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
      Changes: selected sections; coordinates converted to micrometres; counts
               written per cell; CCF parcellation labels joined per cell.
      Citation: Zhang, M. et al. Molecularly defined and spatially resolved cell
                atlas of the whole mouse brain. Nature 624, 343-354 (2023).
                https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06808-9

The Allen Mouse Brain Atlas volumes used for registration are not included
here; they are downloaded at run time by BrainGlobe and are likewise subject to
the Allen Institute Terms of Use (citation: Wang et al. 2020, above).

